id: pm-web-8ynl
title: "Certify pm CLI 2026.9.10, raise the extension compatibility floor to match, and guard the auditor fixes"
description: "CI runs the repo-pinned binaries, so the pins decide what the gates exercise. Advance @unbrained/pm-cli from 2026.9.7 to 2026.9.10 and pm-ops from 2026.9.7 to 2026.9.9. This repository additionally gates that manifest.json pm_min_version equals the exact SDK the standalone server runs, because both the gate verdict and the deployed server depend on which CLI resolves, so the floor moves with the pin. The pm-ops range read as a caret and therefore as tracking the canonical publish-attestation auditor, but npm ci installs the lockfile, which pinned 2026.9.7."
type: Chore
