close_reason: "Pins advanced to CLI 2026.9.10 and pm-ops 2026.9.9, and manifest.json pm_min_version raised from 2026.9.7 to 2026.9.10 so the extension compatibility floor still equals the exact SDK the standalone server runs. npm test passes 395 of 395. The bypass corpus reports clean after the pm-ops bump against seven admitted before, and the seven constructions plus a positive control are now asserted in this repository, verified RED at 2026.9.7 and green at 2026.9.9."
